# Sprint 7.2 — Keep the Docker build context lean.
# Anything that isn't required to build the server image stays out so
# `docker build` doesn't ship 400MB of Next.js / e2e tests / screenshots
# into the daemon.

# Workspaces / artifacts
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Local DB & backups
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
*.sql.gz

# IDE / OS
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
*.log

# Tests / fixtures we don't need at build time
**/tests
e2e
playwright
playwright.config.ts
test-results
screenshots
take-shot.mjs
test-*.mjs

# Docs and meta
*.md
docs

# Web package — server build doesn't need Next.js source
packages/web

# Local env files (never bake secrets into images)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Dockerfile + compose self-references
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.dockerignore
